// Starter projects for the gallery. Each one is a real multi-volume parametric
// composition — the same schema Claude produces — so opening one drops you
// straight into a rich model you can pull apart.
//
// Their napkin thumbnails are not drawings someone made: they are generated by
// projecting the actual massing into an axonometric line drawing and adding a
// hand's worth of wobble. Model and sketch can therefore never disagree.

